Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 04:19:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] test(handler,search): cover the JP #218 finale rules from
 real masterdata rows

Build fixtures from the JP worldBlooms, eventCardBonusLimits,
eventSkillScoreUpLimits and eventShuffleUnitBonuses rows for events
180, 214, 217 and 218:

- 218 resolves as a finale with a 140 skill cap, a member limit of 5
  and shuffle unit bonuses 10/30/50 for 3/4/5 units; 180 keeps 140 and
  4; the WL3 chapter 214 and marathon 217 stay unchanged.
- The deck bonus adds the shuffle rate and a Virtual Singer with a
  support unit counts only as VIRTUAL SINGER.
- Search matches brute force with the shuffle bonus on the finale
  (auto/forced leader, solo), WL chapter and marathon paths.
